WEBVTT

00:00:10.147 --> 00:00:12.247
You're not making any sense.
Would you calm down?

00:00:12.407 --> 00:00:15.047
You come from a great town
with great people
and by my count,

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:16.787
zero bad guys
trying to kill you!

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:22.027
Besides, what could possibly
be more important

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:23.886
than protecting
the people you care about?

00:00:30.231 --> 00:00:32.475
Look, I get your poi--
Whoa!

00:00:32.579 --> 00:00:33.666
[tires squeal]

00:00:33.772 --> 00:00:35.280
Yeah!

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:39.206
[tires screeching]

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:44.397
You know what?
I was wrong about you.

00:00:44.616 --> 00:00:46.177
You're not
the Donut Lord at all.

00:00:46.277 --> 00:00:48.157
You're more like the Jerk Lord.

00:00:48.197 --> 00:00:50.437
Have you noticed the harpoon
stuck in our dash?

00:00:54.827 --> 00:00:56.750
[Sonic yells]
Sonic!

00:00:56.847 --> 00:00:59.287
I was forced from my home.

00:00:59.287 --> 00:01:01.487
Your home is perfect,
and you're leaving it.

00:01:01.546 --> 00:01:02.827
Why would you do that?
[electricity crackling]

00:01:02.935 --> 00:01:05.661
Your body!
Oh, no, not again!

00:01:05.769 --> 00:01:06.896
Hey! Hold on!

00:01:07.006 --> 00:01:08.586
Why?
Because I'm gonna do this.

00:01:08.692 --> 00:01:10.010
[revs engine]

00:01:10.118 --> 00:01:11.791
[yells]

00:01:21.268 --> 00:01:23.476
[tires screech]

00:01:28.107 --> 00:01:29.107
Sonic!

00:01:30.307 --> 00:01:31.307
Sonic!

00:01:31.993 --> 00:01:33.148
[groaning]

00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:38.236
Guess I had a bonus life.

00:01:40.316 --> 00:01:41.836
[gasps]
Oh, yeah, baby!

00:01:42.336 --> 00:01:45.557
Sonic, one. Big Tank, zero.
I'm sorry.

00:01:45.717 --> 00:01:47.517
Did we get that on camera?
How are you not dead?

00:01:47.616 --> 00:01:49.316
I have no idea.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.256
Do you see me dancing?
Yes, I saw you dance.

00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:53.516
Is that all you got?

00:01:53.736 --> 00:01:55.196
No, but thank you for asking.

00:01:56.897 --> 00:01:59.280
[whirs]

00:01:59.426 --> 00:02:01.747
Uh-oh.
Sonic! Get back in the truck!

00:02:02.126 --> 00:02:03.386
[Sonic]
You go. I'll catch up.

00:02:07.512 --> 00:02:08.840
Ha!

00:02:14.297 --> 00:02:16.577
[Sonic] I think that tank
just had a baby.

00:02:24.107 --> 00:02:26.889
[beeping]

00:02:29.857 --> 00:02:30.857
Incoming!

00:02:32.847 --> 00:02:35.827
[boy] It's my turn!
You just had one. It's mine!

00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:38.167
Hey, stop fighting
or I'm taking that thing away!

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:39.031
Yeah, right, Dad.

00:02:39.031 --> 00:02:41.434
[crackling]
[motor dies]

00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:43.629
[tires screech]
[all yelling]

00:02:46.869 --> 00:02:48.611
[all panting]

00:02:50.946 --> 00:02:51.946
Where are you going?

00:02:52.126 --> 00:02:54.626
Just drive the car.
I'll take care of this.

00:02:54.887 --> 00:02:56.927
And if I don't make it,
just ditch me.

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.166
You seem good at that.

00:03:08.596 --> 00:03:09.997
Hey, everyone!
Welcome back to my livestream.

00:03:10.236 --> 00:03:11.457
Today we're destroying robots.

00:03:11.596 --> 00:03:12.676
Step one.

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:19.016
Yes, we did it!

00:03:23.647 --> 00:03:26.507
We did not do it.
Who isthis guy?

00:03:26.927 --> 00:03:29.127
Ever wonder where
your tax dollars are going?

00:03:29.347 --> 00:03:30.347
My turn.

00:03:30.407 --> 00:03:31.507
Here, just keep us
going straight.

00:03:32.047 --> 00:03:33.047
I put it in cruise control.

00:03:33.207 --> 00:03:35.167
[chuckles]
I feel just like Vin Diesel.

00:03:35.487 --> 00:03:36.806
"It's all about family, Tom."

00:03:44.197 --> 00:03:45.296
[grunts]
[Sonic] Quick suggestion.

00:03:45.557 --> 00:03:48.017
Roll up into a ball
and smash him with your body.

00:03:49.396 --> 00:03:51.696
Whoa! Where'd you
learn how to drive?

00:03:51.816 --> 00:03:54.296
Here. In this truck.
It's happening as we speak.

00:03:57.096 --> 00:03:59.196
I can't reach it.
Bring him in closer.

00:03:59.477 --> 00:04:01.077
What?
Bring it in closer!

00:04:01.197 --> 00:04:03.296
Hit the brakes.
Oh, you mean this one?

00:04:04.336 --> 00:04:05.336
[engine revs]
The other brakes!

00:04:05.438 --> 00:04:07.040
[tires squeal]

00:04:12.087 --> 00:04:14.406
[warbles, dies]

00:04:14.508 --> 00:04:16.793
Ha-ha! Whoo!

00:04:17.714 --> 00:04:19.384
Oh!

00:04:19.487 --> 00:04:22.647
Give me a big, fat break!

00:04:27.946 --> 00:04:30.566
Aw, this one is cute.
Let's keep him.

00:04:31.961 --> 00:04:33.248
Aah!

00:04:33.947 --> 00:04:35.467
[Tom] Oh, come on!

00:04:35.586 --> 00:04:37.707
[Sonic] How could something
so adorable be so terrible?

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.667
You've got car insurance, right?

00:04:43.359 --> 00:04:44.709
[both yelling]

00:04:49.707 --> 00:04:50.707
Buzz off.

00:04:51.587 --> 00:04:52.587
[beeping]
That doesn't sound good.

00:04:52.627 --> 00:04:54.866
No, beeping is bad.
Get rid of it!
I'm trying.

00:04:54.965 --> 00:04:56.656
Throw it out the win--
Throw it anywhere!

00:04:56.755 --> 00:04:59.308
I can't get it off.
All right, I'm pulling over.

00:05:01.066 --> 00:05:02.492
[beeping continues]

00:05:02.591 --> 00:05:05.111
[Sonic grunting]

00:05:06.736 --> 00:05:09.136
Did I get it?
Nope.

00:05:09.237 --> 00:05:10.255
[yelps]

00:05:10.357 --> 00:05:11.357
Here. Hold still.

00:05:12.776 --> 00:05:14.417
It's going,
it's going...

00:05:14.877 --> 00:05:15.877
It's still here.
[beeping accelerates]

00:05:19.097 --> 00:05:20.197
Get off me.

00:05:21.056 --> 00:05:22.676
Ha-ha! Nailed it!

00:05:23.143 --> 00:05:25.445
[both grunt]

00:05:32.386 --> 00:05:33.386
Sonic!

